[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9720.07, "timestamp": "02:42:00", "text": "哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9722.309, "timestamp": "02:42:02", "text": "不，不。如果你的……你也应该服用一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9724.27, "timestamp": "02:42:04", "text": "健康状况并非百分之百。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.429, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "我的健康值应该是100。啊，那真是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9729.349, "timestamp": "02:42:09", "text": "美好的。美好的。没关系。哦，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.59, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "没问题吧？是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9735.11, "timestamp": "02:42:15", "text": "好的。我喜欢这个地方。我喜欢这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.429, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9739.51, "timestamp": "02:42:19", "text": "好吧，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9743.19, "timestamp": "02:42:23", "text": "等等，这样行得通吗？那我就不介意了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9745.67, "timestamp": "02:42:25", "text": "我开玩笑的。城堡建好了。我觉得是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9747.349, "timestamp": "02:42:27", "text": "作品。进来。进来。进来。进来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.429, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "好的。我应该这样做吗？大家都到齐了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.95, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "是的。你们都给我发垃圾邮件。我们进去了。垃圾邮件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9758.469, "timestamp": "02:42:38", "text": "我。给我发垃圾邮件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9761.349, "timestamp": "02:42:41", "text": "开始发送垃圾邮件吧。你完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9771.19, "timestamp": "02:42:51", "text": "耶！满血。是这个吗？这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9773.67, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "text": "哦，其中一个是我的。之一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9776.469, "timestamp": "02:42:56", "text": "它们是我的。不，不，不，不，不。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9779.27, "timestamp": "02:42:59", "text": "买了。是我自己买的。"}]